    skos:definition 'The sample was doped with radioactive dissolved inorganic carbon, retained for a predetermined time at the specified light level, acidified to remove any remaining radioactive carbonate and a scintillant added for radiation level determination.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S03::S0339'^^xsd:string .
