    skos:definition 'Radioactive dimethlyl sulphide was added to the sample prior to retention in darkness for a predetermined period, filtration to separate dissolved and particulate phases and stripping of gases from the dissolved phase by bubbling through an inert gas.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S03::S0345'^^xsd:string .
