    skos:definition 'Radioactive dimethlylsulphoniopropionate was added to the sample prior to retention in darkness for a predetermined period and filtration to separate dissolved and particulate phases.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:S03::S0346'^^xsd:string .
